      "en": "Blizzard Moves WoW: Forever Stress Test to October 21",
      "es": "Blizzard traslada WoW: Forever Stress Test al 21 de octubre"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Blizzard Moves WoW: Forever Stress Test to October 21...",
      "es": "Blizzard traslada WoW: Forever Stress Test al 21 de octubre..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad2b81db3d4d3.48322336\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has moved the WoW: Forever Stress Test to October 21st, instead of the previously announced October 19th. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/join-the-world-of-warcraft-forever-stress-test-on-october-19th-383449\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">WoW: Forever Stress Test</span></a></div><br><br>The WoW: Forever stress test is open to everyone, with no beta key, subscription or invitation needed.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2383617/39\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Please note that we will do the Stress Test on October 21, not two days earlier as previously stated.<br><br>Thank you!</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has moved the WoW: Forever Stress Test to October 21st, instead of the previously announced October 19th. <br /><br />WoW: Forever Stress Test<br /><br />The WoW: Forever stress test is open to everyone, with no beta key, subscription or invitation needed.<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">Please note that we will do the Stress Test on October 21, not two days earlier as previously stated.<br /><br />Thank you!</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55814-blizzard-moves-wow-forever-stress-test-to-october-21.jpg",
