    "badgeColor": "border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300",
    "title": {
      "en": "Blizzard Identifies Likely Issue of Falling Through Kindo'jan's Platform in Labyrinths",
      "es": "Blizzard identifica un posible problema de caída a través de la plataforma de Kindo'jan en laberintos"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Blizzard Identifies Likely Issue of Falling Through Kindo'jan's Platform in Labyrinths...",
      "es": "Blizzard identifica el probable problema de caer a través de la plataforma de Kindo'jan en los laberintos..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad2b79f6e45b4.68585384\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard has announced that have identified the likely cause of the Kindo'jan floor bug, where players would fall through the floor, preventing completion of the run. <br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><a class=\"wh-button zam-button\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/guide/midnight/delves/labyrinth-of-kindojan-megadelve-nemesis-rewards\" data-style=\"cta\" data-variation=\"undefined\"><span class=\"wh-button-text body-text zam-button-text\" data-text-style=\"body-small-bold\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Labyrinth of Kindo'jan</span><span class=\"wh-button-icon zam-button-icon\"><img src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_cape_armor_troll_d_01.jpg\" alt=\"\"></span></a></div><br><br>Since the launch of Patch 12.1.5, players <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/players-reporting-progression-bricking-bugs-still-persist-in-labyrinths-383439\" data-contiguous=\"true\">have reported an issue</a> where Kindo'jan's arena has no collision. This would prevent players from completing their run. Blizzard has now identified a likely issue and is working on a fix.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2382565/7\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">We’ve identified a likely root cause of this issue. Under a very specific set of conditions, two map configurations can overlap unexpectedly, causing portions of the Labyrinth to disappear. Because the issue only occurs in this particular situation, it was difficult to catch during testing. The team is actively validating fix options, and we’ll provide an update as soon as a fix has been implemented.</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard has announced that have identified the likely cause of the Kindo'jan floor bug, where players would fall through the floor, preventing completion of the run. <br /><br />Labyrinth of Kindo'jan<br /><br />Since the launch of Patch 12.1.5, players <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/news/players-reporting-progression-bricking-bugs-still-persist-in-labyrinths-383439\">have reported an issue</a> where Kindo'jan's arena has no collision. This would prevent players from completing their run. Blizzard has now identified a likely issue and is working on a fix.<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">We’ve identified a likely root cause of this issue. Under a very specific set of conditions, two map configurations can overlap unexpectedly, causing portions of the Labyrinth to disappear. Because the issue only occurs in this particular situation, it was difficult to catch during testing. The team is actively validating fix options, and we’ll provide an update as soon as a fix has been implemented.</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55812-blizzard-identifies-likely-issue-of-falling-through-kindojans-platform-in.jpg",
