    "title": {
      "en": "Blizzard Clarifies Recent Art Assets Discovered on the WoW: Forever Beta",
      "es": "Blizzard aclara los activos artísticos recientes descubiertos en la beta de WoW: Forever"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Blizzard Clarifies Recent Art Assets Discovered on the WoW: Forever Beta...",
      "es": "Blizzard aclara los activos artísticos recientes descubiertos en la beta de WoW: Forever..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad2b7423115d1.03884732\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">In the latest WoW: Forever beta build, several mounts, pets, toys, and transmog sets <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/potential-new-mounts-pets-and-cosmetics-discovered-in-latest-wow-forever-build-383463\" data-contiguous=\"true\">were discovered</a>. Many players raised concerns about their appearance, saying that it didn't match the Classic vibe, and Blizzard has released a statement regarding these models:<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2385060/1\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">A number of art assets were recently datamined in the latest Beta build of WoW Forever.<br><br>While we appreciate the feedback and discussion online, please be advised that these assets are not intended for this version of World of Warcraft.</div></div>Due to the different versions of World of Warcraft that exist, It's not unheard of for tactkeys to be discovered on one version that don't necessarily apply to that version. For example, the recent Rexxar shop sets were <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/news/new-rexxar-cosmetics-and-faction-tabards-found-on-chinas-latest-titan-reforged-382304\" data-contiguous=\"true\">first discovered on China's Titan Reforged servers</a>. We don't know what version of WoW this batch of models is intended for, so we'll just have to wait for an official announcement if and when these items come to the game!</div>\n            \n            <noscript>In the latest WoW: Forever beta build, several mounts, pets, toys, and transmog sets <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/potential-new-mounts-pets-and-cosmetics-discovered-in-latest-wow-forever-build-383463\">were discovered</a>. Many players raised concerns about their appearance, saying that it didn't match the Classic vibe, and Blizzard has released a statement regarding these models:<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">A number of art assets were recently datamined in the latest Beta build of WoW Forever.<br /><br />While we appreciate the feedback and discussion online, please be advised that these assets are not intended for this version of World of Warcraft.</div></div><br /><br />Due to the different versions of World of Warcraft that exist, It's not unheard of for tactkeys to be discovered on one version that don't necessarily apply to that version. For example, the recent Rexxar shop sets were <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/news/new-rexxar-cosmetics-and-faction-tabards-found-on-chinas-latest-titan-reforged-382304\">first discovered on China's Titan Reforged servers</a>. We don't know what version of WoW this batch of models is intended for, so we'll just have to wait for an official announcement if and when these items come to the game!</noscript>            \n        ",
    "imageUrl": "https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/blog/images/55810-blizzard-clarifies-recent-art-assets-discovered-on-the-wow-forever-beta.jpg",
