    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad2b6b677a8c2.54091801\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Pull10Podcast\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Pull 10</a> is a Classic+ podcast hosted by content creators <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/joardee\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Joardee</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/rencognito\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">rencognito</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/jurdijd\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">JurdiJD</a>. This week, they're joined by special guest Tipsout, organizer of the current WoW: Forever Beta Tournament with a $100,000 dollar prize pool!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"wh-youtube exclude-units lazy-load-background\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; background: url(&quot;https://i.ytimg.com/vi/Pr7IpGW97Ac/sddefault.jpg&quot;); max-width: 640px;\"><a aria-label=\"Play\" class=\"wh-youtube-inner\" href=\"javascript:\" style=\"padding-top: 56.25%;\"><i class=\"fa fa-play-circle\"></i></a></div></div><div class=\"quote-box exclude-units\" data-type=\"user\" data-has-source=\"false\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">What is the direction for PvP in WoW: Forever? And what is the future of tournaments and competition for this potential game?</div></div><hr>Subscribe to the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Pull10Podcast\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Pull 10 YouTube</a> channel for weekly episodes, follow them on <a href=\"https://x.com/pull10podcast\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>, subscribe to their <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/Pull10\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a> for excluisive content, and be sure to check out the <a href=\"https://wowclassic.plus/home[/url\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">Classic+ Project</a> to vote and discuss everything <b>you think</b> should be included in World of Warcraft: Forever.</div>\n            \n            <noscript><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Pull10Podcast\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull 10</a> is a Classic+ podcast hosted by content creators <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/joardee\" rel=\"nofollow\">Joardee</a>, <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/rencognito\" rel=\"nofollow\">rencognito</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/jurdijd\" rel=\"nofollow\">JurdiJD</a>. This week, they're joined by special guest Tipsout, organizer of the current WoW: Forever Beta Tournament with a $100,000 dollar prize pool!<br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\"><br /><br />What is the direction for PvP in WoW: Forever? And what is the future of tournaments and competition for this potential game?<br /><br /></div><br /><br />Subscribe to the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Pull10Podcast\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pull 10 YouTube</a> channel for weekly episodes, follow them on <a href=\"https://x.com/pull10podcast\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a>, subscribe to their <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/cw/Pull10\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a> for excluisive content, and be sure to check out the <a href=\"https://wowclassic.plus/home[/url\" rel=\"nofollow\">Classic+ Project</a> to vote and discuss everything <b>you think</b> should be included in World of Warcraft: Forever.</noscript>            \n        ",
