  {
    "id": "wh-383463",
    "source": "wowhead",
    "dateRaw": "Fri, 16 Oct 2026 14:36:13 -0500",
    "author": "Wowhead Staff",
    "category": "Live",
    "badgeColor": "border-amber-500/60 bg-amber-950/80 text-amber-300",
    "title": {
      "en": "Potential New Mounts, Pets, and Cosmetics Discovered in Latest WoW: Forever Build",
      "es": "Posibles nuevas monturas, mascotas y cosméticos descubiertos en el último WoW: Forever Build"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Potential New Mounts, Pets, and Cosmetics Discovered in Latest WoW: Forever Build...",
      "es": "Potenciales nuevas monturas, mascotas y cosméticos descubiertos en el último WoW: Forever Build..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad2b687dcd952.30210303\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\"><div class=\"markup-grid exclude-units\" data-align=\"centered\" style=\"--markup-gridColumnBasis: 800px;\"><div class=\"last\" style=\"border:2px solid red; padding:10px;\"><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><b>Blizzard has released a Blue Post regarding the models in this post. They've clarified that the assets are not intended for use in WoW: Forever. You can read more <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/blizzard-clarifies-recent-art-assets-discovered-on-the-wow-forever-beta-383472\" data-contiguous=\"true\">here</a>. <br></b></div></div></div><br><br>The most recent Forever beta build has revealed several new mounts, pets, and cosmetics that might potentially be added. Spoilers ahead!<div class=\"pad exclude-units\"></div><div class=\"pad exclude-units\"></div><div class=\"\" style=\"max-width:600px; margin:20px auto; font-family:Arial;\"><div class=\"first last\" style=\"border:2px solid #8c1515; border-radius:10px; background:rgba(120,41,41,0.05); overflow:visible; position:relative; padding-top:20px;\"><div class=\"first\" style=\"display:inline-block; background:#8c1515; color:white; font-weight:bold; padding:5px 14px; border-radius:8px; position:absolute; top:-18px; left:12px;\">More Information:</div><div class=\"last\" style=\"padding:12px; line-height:1.5; font-size:15px; display:inline-block;\">Many of these models may look familiar to Retail players - no, this is not a mistake. These models were recently discovered through tactkeys that have appeared in Forever. This doesn't confirm that these items will eventually be in-game, only that the models have been found; we can only confirm that they exist, not that they are being released, and can pair them with items that were added in this recent build.</div></div></div><h2 id=\"mounts\" class=\"heading-size-2 heading-bar\"><span data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Mounts</span></h2>The <a class=\"q4 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=286756/spectral-wolf-pack\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Spectral Wolf Pack\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/8408196.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Spectral Wolf Pack</span></a> in particular is very interesting - this mount looks like it allows party members to ride the mount as well, on their own wolfpack summons. How this would work is unknown, since two-or-three-seater mounts before now have all been on one unit.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div></div><h2 id=\"pets\" class=\"heading-size-2 heading-bar\"><span data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Pets</span></h2>Much like on Retail, the <a class=\"q3 icontiny\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\" data-entity=\"item\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=98550/blossoming-ancient\" data-entity-has-icon=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\"><img alt=\"Blossoming Ancient\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/874857.gif\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;\"> <span class=\"tinyicontxt\">Blossoming Ancient</span></a> looks like it changes appearance based on the season it is summoned in.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div>&nbsp;<div class=\"entity-model-card-embed-wrapper\"></div></div><h2 id=\"toys\" class=\"heading-size-2 heading-bar\"><span data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Toys</span></h2>Only one toy was discovered, but it looks like it will have a fun effect on camping, allowing for cosmetic tent appearance changes.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span data-markup-tooltip-container=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\" class=\"wowhead-tooltip-inline exclude-units wowhead-tooltip-inline-icon\"><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip wowhead-tooltip-width-restriction wowhead-tooltip-width-320\" data-game=\"wow\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-type=\"item\" data-visible=\"yes\" style=\"width: 320px; visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"whtt-tooltip-icon\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"iconmedium\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\"><ins style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_10_tailoring2_tent_color3.jpg&quot;);\" class=\"lazy-load-background\"></ins><del></del></div></div><table><tbody><tr><td><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--nstart--><b class=\"q1\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=288185/adventurers-tent\" data-disable-wowhead-tooltip=\"true\">Adventurer's Tent</a></b><!--nend--><!--ndstart--><!--ndend--><span class=\"q whtt-extra whtt-ilvl\"><br>Item Level <!--ilvl-->1</span><!--bo--><br>Binds when picked up<!--ue--><!--ue--><br><span class=\"toycolor\">Toy</span><!--ebstats--><!--egstats--><!--eistats--><!--nameDescStats--></td></tr></tbody></table><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--useText:0:1--><span id=\"useText1\" class=\"q2\">Use: <!--useEffect:0:1--><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/spell=1325145/adventurers-tent\" class=\"q2\">Summons a miniature Adventurer's Tent for 15 min. Camp Tents placed during this time will have the Adventurer's Tent appearance.</a> (15 Min Cooldown)<!--useEffect:1--></span><!--useText:1--><!--itemEffects:1--><br><!--pvpEquip--><!--pvpEquip--><div class=\"whtt-sellprice\">Sell Price: <span class=\"moneygold\">75</span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><th style=\"background-position: right top;\"></th></tr><tr><th style=\"background-position: left bottom;\"></th><th style=\"background-position: right bottom;\"></th></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip-powered\"></div></div></span><br><br><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305785.jpg\" id=\"1305785\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305785.jpg?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"adventurers tent\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 5.18474 / 1;\"></a></div><h2 id=\"transmog\" class=\"heading-size-2 heading-bar\"><span data-markup-content-target=\"1\">Transmog</span></h2>Both of these ensembles come with several pieces of gear, although the Blademaster set comes with more pieces total.<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span data-markup-tooltip-container=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\" class=\"wowhead-tooltip-inline exclude-units wowhead-tooltip-inline-icon\"><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip wowhead-tooltip-width-restriction wowhead-tooltip-width-280.46875\" data-game=\"wow\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-type=\"item\" data-visible=\"yes\" style=\"width: 280.469px; visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"whtt-tooltip-icon\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"iconmedium\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\"><ins style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/8382586.jpg&quot;);\" class=\"lazy-load-background\"></ins><del></del></div></div><table><tbody><tr><td><table style=\"white-space: nowrap; width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--nstart--><b class=\"q3\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=287647/ensemble-gilded-blademasters-armor\" data-disable-wowhead-tooltip=\"true\">Ensemble: Gilded Blademaster's Armor</a></b><!--nend--><!--ndstart--><!--ndend--><span class=\"q whtt-extra whtt-ilvl\"><br>Item Level <!--ilvl-->1</span><!--bo--><br>Binds when picked up<!--ue--><!--ue--><!--ebstats--><!--egstats--><!--eistats--><!--nameDescStats--></td></tr></tbody></table><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--useText:0:1--><span id=\"useText1\" class=\"q2\">Use: <!--useEffect:0:1--><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/spell=1323998/ensemble-gilded-blademasters-armor\" class=\"q2\">Collect the appearances of this armor set.</a><!--useEffect:1--></span><!--useText:1--><!--itemEffects:1--><br><!--pvpEquip--><!--pvpEquip--></td></tr></tbody></table></td><th style=\"background-position: right top;\"></th></tr><tr><th style=\"background-position: left bottom;\"></th><th style=\"background-position: right bottom;\"></th></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip-powered\"></div></div></span>&nbsp;<span data-markup-tooltip-container=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\" class=\"wowhead-tooltip-inline exclude-units wowhead-tooltip-inline-icon\"><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip wowhead-tooltip-width-restriction wowhead-tooltip-width-280.46875\" data-game=\"wow\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-type=\"item\" data-visible=\"yes\" style=\"width: 280.469px; visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"whtt-tooltip-icon\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"iconmedium\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\"><ins style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/6893245.jpg&quot;);\" class=\"lazy-load-background\"></ins><del></del></div></div><table><tbody><tr><td><table style=\"white-space: nowrap; width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--nstart--><b class=\"q1\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=244231/ensemble-stillwater-fisher-attire\" data-disable-wowhead-tooltip=\"true\">Ensemble: Stillwater Fisher Attire</a></b><!--nend--><!--ndstart--><!--ndend--><span class=\"q whtt-extra whtt-ilvl\"><br>Item Level <!--ilvl-->1</span><!--bo--><br>Binds to Account<!--ue--><!--ue--><!--ebstats--><!--egstats--><!--eistats--><!--nameDescStats--></td></tr></tbody></table><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--useText:0:1--><span id=\"useText1\" class=\"q2\">Use: <!--useEffect:0:1--><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/spell=1236676/ensemble-stillwater-fisher-attire\" class=\"q2\">Collect the appearances of this armor set.</a><!--useEffect:1--></span><!--useText:1--><!--itemEffects:1--><br><!--pvpEquip--><!--pvpEquip--></td></tr></tbody></table></td><th style=\"background-position: right top;\"></th></tr><tr><th style=\"background-position: left bottom;\"></th><th style=\"background-position: right bottom;\"></th></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip-powered\"></div></div></span><br><br><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305859.jpg\" id=\"1305859\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305859.jpg?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"blademaster\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 2.86353 / 1;\"></a><br><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305789.jpg\" id=\"1305789\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305789.jpg?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"fishing\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 2.42454 / 1;\"></a></div><br><br>There's also a totem back piece that doesn't look to be associated with an ensemble. Along with that, take a closer look at the Blademaster sword!<br><br><div class=\"wh-center\" style=\"text-align: -webkit-center;\"><span data-markup-tooltip-container=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\" class=\"wowhead-tooltip-inline exclude-units wowhead-tooltip-inline-icon\"><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip wowhead-tooltip-width-restriction wowhead-tooltip-width-189.78125\" data-game=\"wow\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-type=\"item\" data-visible=\"yes\" style=\"width: 189.781px; visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"whtt-tooltip-icon\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"iconmedium\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\"><ins style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/8392824.jpg&quot;);\" class=\"lazy-load-background\"></ins><del></del></div></div><table><tbody><tr><td><table style=\"white-space: nowrap; width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--nstart--><b class=\"q3\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=287620/rugged-totemic-backpack\" data-disable-wowhead-tooltip=\"true\">Rugged Totemic Backpack</a></b><!--nend--><!--ndstart--><!--ndend--><span class=\"q\"><br>Item Level <!--ilvl-->1</span><!--bo--><br>Binds when picked up<!--ue--><!--ue--><table width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td>Back</td></tr></tbody></table><!--rf--><!--ebstats--><!--egstats--><!--eistats--><!--nameDescStats--><!--rs--><!--e--><!--ps--></td></tr></tbody></table><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--rr--><!--itemEffects:0--><!--pvpEquip--><!--pvpEquip--><div class=\"whtt-sellprice\">Sell Price: <span class=\"moneycopper\">2</span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><th style=\"background-position: right top;\"></th></tr><tr><th style=\"background-position: left bottom;\"></th><th style=\"background-position: right bottom;\"></th></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip-powered\"></div></div></span>&nbsp;<span data-markup-tooltip-container=\"true\" data-contiguous=\"true\" class=\"wowhead-tooltip-inline exclude-units wowhead-tooltip-inline-icon\"><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip wowhead-tooltip-width-restriction wowhead-tooltip-width-238.984375\" data-game=\"wow\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-type=\"item\" data-visible=\"yes\" style=\"width: 238.984px; visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"whtt-tooltip-icon\" style=\"visibility: visible;\"><div class=\"iconmedium\" data-env=\"classicplus\" data-tree=\"classicplus\" data-game=\"wow\" data-type=\"item\"><ins style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/8422168.jpg&quot;);\" class=\"lazy-load-background\"></ins><del></del></div></div><table><tbody><tr><td><table style=\"white-space: nowrap; width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--nstart--><b class=\"q3\"><a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/item=287648/gilded-blademasters-greatsword\" data-disable-wowhead-tooltip=\"true\">Gilded Blademaster's Greatsword</a></b><!--nend--><!--ndstart--><!--ndend--><span class=\"q\"><br>Item Level <!--ilvl-->1</span><!--bo--><br>Binds when picked up<!--ue--><!--ue--><table width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr><td>Two-Hand</td><th><!--scstart2:8--><span class=\"q1\">Sword</span><!--scend--></th></tr></tbody></table><!--rf--><table width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n    <td><span><!--dmg-->14 - 22 Damage</span></td>\n    <th>Speed <!--spd-->3.60</th>\n</tr></tbody></table><!--dps-->(5.00 damage per second)<!--ebstats--><!--egstats--><!--eistats--><!--nameDescStats--><!--rs--><!--e--><!--ps--></td></tr></tbody></table><table style=\"width: 100%;\"><tbody><tr><td><!--rr--><!--itemEffects:0--><!--pvpEquip--><!--pvpEquip--><div class=\"whtt-sellprice\">Sell Price: <span class=\"moneycopper\">12</span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></td><th style=\"background-position: right top;\"></th></tr><tr><th style=\"background-position: left bottom;\"></th><th style=\"background-position: right bottom;\"></th></tr></tbody></table><div class=\"wowhead-tooltip-powered\"></div></div></span><br><br><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305788.jpg\" id=\"1305788\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305788.jpg?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"totem backpack\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 3.94169 / 1;\"></a><br><a href=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305787.jpg\" id=\"1305787\"><img width=\"800\" src=\"https://wow.zamimg.com/uploads/screenshots/normal/1305787.jpg?maxWidth=800\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"content-image\" alt=\"blademaster sword\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; aspect-ratio: 4.59524 / 1;\"></a></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript><b>Blizzard has released a Blue Post regarding the models in this post. They've clarified that the assets are not intended for use in WoW: Forever. You can read more <a href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/forever/news/blizzard-clarifies-recent-art-assets-discovered-on-the-wow-forever-beta-383472\">here</a>. <br /></b> <br /><br />The most recent Forever beta build has revealed several new mounts, pets, and cosmetics that might potentially be added. Spoilers ahead!<br /><br />More Information:<br />Many of these models may look familiar to Retail players - no, this is not a mistake. These models were recently discovered through tactkeys that have appeared in Forever. This doesn't confirm that these items will eventually be in-game, only that the models have been found; we can only confirm that they exist, not that they are being released, and can pair them with items that were added in this recent build.<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Mounts</h2><br /><br />The <a href=\"/forever/item=286756/spectral-wolf-pack\">Spectral Wolf Pack</a> in particular is very interesting - this mount looks like it allows party members to ride the mount as well, on their own wolfpack summons. How this would work is unknown, since two-or-three-seater mounts before now have all been on one unit.<br /><br /><a href=\"/forever/mount/3169\">Spectral Wolf Pack</a> <a href=\"/forever/mount/3168\">Crimson Rooster</a> <a href=\"/forever/mount/3167\">Verdant Sea Turtle</a><br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Pets</h2><br /><br />Much like on Retail, the <a href=\"/forever/item=98550/blossoming-ancient\">Blossoming Ancient</a> looks like it changes appearance based on the season it is summoned in.<br /><br /><a href=\"/forever/npc=266912/pinky\">Pinky</a> <a href=\"/forever/npc=71488/blossoming-ancient\">Blossoming Ancient</a> <a href=\"/forever/npc=230834/gillel\">Gill'el</a><br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Toys</h2><br /><br />Only one toy was discovered, but it looks like it will have a fun effect on camping, allowing for cosmetic tent appearance changes.<br /><br /><h2 class=\"heading-size-2\">Transmog</h2><br /><br />Both of these ensembles come with several pieces of gear, although the Blademaster set comes with more pieces total.<br /><br />There's also a totem back piece that doesn't look to be associated with an ensemble. Along with that, take a closer look at the Blademaster sword!<br /><br /></noscript>            \n        ",
