      "en": "Blizzard Investigating Valeera Survivability Issues in Patch 12.1.5",
      "es": "Blizzard investiga los problemas de supervivencia de Valeera en el parche 12.1.5"
    },
    "summary": {
      "en": "Blizzard Investigating Valeera Survivability Issues in Patch 12.1.5...",
      "es": "Blizzard investiga los problemas de supervivencia de Valeera en el parche 12.1.5..."
    },
    "contentHtml": "\n            <div id=\"news-post-6ad2b8c9503be9.99456102\" data-insert-ads=\"article\" data-zaf-dynamic=\"article\" data-units-dynamic=\"article\" data-zaf-slot=\"true\">Blizzard is investigating survivability issues with Valeera in Patch 12.1.5 and will provide an update when they have more info. <br><br>Many players have reported issues with Valeera's survivability in Patch 12.1.5, such as <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/wow/comments/1x6s3fn/dundun_was_fixed_and_is_back_in_delves_but/\" data-contiguous=\"true\" target=\"_blank\">on Reddit</a>. It's unclear exactly what the issue is, but Blizzard is looking into it.<div class=\"quote-box exclude-units last\" data-type=\"blizzard\" data-has-links=\"true\" data-has-source=\"true\" data-has-toggle=\"true\"><div class=\"quote-source\">Blizzard</div><div class=\"quote-header\"><a href=\"https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/2381701/73\" target=\"_blank\">View Original</a><a class=\"quote-toggle\" href=\"javascript:\" aria-label=\"Toggle quote visibility\"></a></div><div class=\"quote-body\" data-markup-content-target=\"1\">We’re investigating the issue with Valeera’s survivability since the update. Thank you for all your detailed reports so far!<br><br>We’ll be sure to provide an update once we have more info.</div></div></div>\n            \n            <noscript>Blizzard is investigating survivability issues with Valeera in Patch 12.1.5 and will provide an update when they have more info. <br /><br />Many players have reported issues with Valeera's survivability in Patch 12.1.5, such as <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/wow/comments/1x6s3fn/dundun_was_fixed_and_is_back_in_delves_but/\">on Reddit</a>. It's unclear exactly what the issue is, but Blizzard is looking into it. <br /><br /><div class=\"quote-box\" data-type=\"blizzard\"><div class=\"quote-header\"></div><div class=\"quote-body\">We’re investigating the issue with Valeera’s survivability since the update. Thank you for all your detailed reports so far!<br /><br />We’ll be sure to provide an update once we have more info.</div></div></noscript>            \n        ",
